WEBVTT

00:04:28.220 --> 00:04:33.035
Perhaps the most fundamental way
in which the third side can help

00:04:33.059 --> 00:04:35.976
is to remind the parties
of what's really at stake.

00:04:36.336 --> 00:04:38.840
For the sake of the kids,
for the sake of the family,

00:04:38.864 --> 00:04:41.634
for the sake of the community,
for the sake of the future,

00:04:41.658 --> 00:04:44.099
let's stop fighting for a moment
and start talking.

00:04:44.806 --> 00:04:46.281
Because, the thing is,

00:04:46.305 --> 00:04:47.878
when we're involved in conflict,

00:04:47.902 --> 00:04:50.461
it's very easy to lose perspective.

00:04:50.485 --> 00:04:52.524
It's very easy to react.

00:04:52.548 --> 00:04:55.421
Human beings -- we're reaction machines.

00:04:55.445 --> 00:04:56.818
And as the saying goes,

00:04:56.842 --> 00:04:59.365
when angry, you will make the best speech

00:04:59.389 --> 00:05:00.874
you will ever regret.